<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia UEM 1996 net up 90 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia UEM 1996 net up 90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    71.3	  vs	  49.4</p>
<p>    Net profit	    513.21	 vs	 269.58</p>
<p>    Turnover	    3,405.58	 vs     1,808.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	704.16	 vs	 375.30</p>
<p>    Minorities     less 102.20	 vs  less  61.13</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 6.04	 vs	   8.18</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)     15.0	  vs	  15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - United Engineers (Malaysia) Bhd is engaged in infrastructure construction and the operation of toll highways.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
